        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Martin, Kyle Patrick\n- Bands: The Tea Party, The Click Five\n- Works: Live at the Corner Hotel\n- Places: Windsor, Ontario; Atlanta, Georgia; Boston\n\nFacts:\n- Jeff Martin was born on October 2, 1969, in Windsor, Ontario.\n- Jeff Martin is a Canadian guitarist and singer-songwriter best known for fronting the rock band The Tea Party.\n- Kyle Patrick Dickherber was born on May 20, 1986, in Atlanta, Georgia, United States.\n- Kyle Patrick is an American singer-songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, and producer best known as the lead singer of the Boston power pop band The Click Five.\n- Jeff Martin began his career as a solo artist in October 2005, when The Tea Party went on hiatus.\n- Live at the Corner Hotel is a 2008 live album by Canadian singer-songwriter Jeff Martin.",
